  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">03 Provide malnutrition prev. support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country portfolio budget - CPB Sierra Leone 2026-2030 Provide comprehensive malnutrition prevention support, including complementary food to children aged 6 -23 months and nutrition messaging to breastfeeding mothers and adolescent girls, while supporting national actors to increase availability and affordability of locally fortified food, including through national systems and programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
